{
 "component": "Gauge",
 "version": 3,
 "summary": "A 240° dial gauge: a value arc from min to max, green, then amber past warnAt and red past alertAt, with the value and a label in the centre. Or, with bandLo and bandHi, an ideal band (soil moisture 40-70 %) marked on the track: the value is green inside it and amber below or above it.",
 "params": {
  "value": {
   "type": "float",
   "required": true,
   "doc": "A number or a \"@variable\", in min..max (clamped for the arc)"
  },
  "min": {
   "type": "float",
   "default": 0,
   "doc": "Value at the start of the arc; leave it 0 when you can (a shorter expression)"
  },
  "max": {
   "type": "float",
   "default": 100,
   "doc": "Value at the end of the arc"
  },
  "label": {
   "type": "string",
   "default": "",
   "doc": "Under the value, e.g. \"CPU %\"; also the accessibility label"
  },
  "warnAt": {
   "type": "float",
   "default": 0.6,
   "doc": "Fraction of the range where amber starts"
  },
  "alertAt": {
   "type": "float",
   "default": 0.85,
   "doc": "Fraction where red starts"
  },
  "bandLo": {
   "type": "float",
   "doc": "Bottom of the ideal band, in value units (min..max), a number or a \"@variable\". With bandHi, the track shows the band and the value is green inside it, amber outside; warnAt and alertAt are then unused. Default: no band"
  },
  "bandHi": {
   "type": "float",
   "doc": "Top of the ideal band, in value units, a number or a \"@variable\"; giving it is what turns the band on (needs bandLo too). The ends are inclusive: a value equal to bandLo or bandHi is in the band"
  },
  "size": {
   "type": "float",
   "default": 140,
   "static": true,
   "doc": "Width and height in dp: the design size the drawing is scaled from (with fill, or when the parent is smaller)"
  },
  "fill": {
   "type": "bool",
   "default": false,
   "static": true,
   "doc": "Fill the space the caller gives it (fillMaxSize) instead of a fixed size; give it a parent with a size or a weight. The drawing is scaled to the box either way"
  },
  "thickness": {
   "type": "float",
   "default": 12,
   "static": true,
   "doc": "Arc stroke width in dp"
  },
  "decimals": {
   "type": "float",
   "default": 0,
   "static": true,
   "doc": "Digits after the point in the centre value"
  }
 },
 "locals": {
  "frac": {
   "$if": "min",
   "then": "(@value - @min) / (@max - @min)",
   "else": "@value / @max"
  },
  "sweep": "clamp(0, 240, @frac * 240)",
  "bandA": {
   "$if": "bandHi",
   "then": {
    "$if": "min",
    "then": "150 + clamp(0, 240, (@bandLo - @min) / (@max - @min) * 240)",
    "else": "150 + clamp(0, 240, @bandLo / @max * 240)"
   },
   "else": 0
  },
  "bandB": {
   "$if": "bandHi",
   "then": {
    "$if": "min",
    "then": "150 + clamp(0, 240, (@bandHi - @min) / (@max - @min) * 240)",
    "else": "150 + clamp(0, 240, @bandHi / @max * 240)"
   },
   "else": 0
  },
  "inBand": {
   "$if": "bandHi",
   "then": "(1 - step(@bandLo, @value)) * (1 - step(@value, @bandHi))",
   "else": 0
  }
 },
 "capabilities": [
  "draw.arc",
  "text.dynamic",
  "data.condition"
 ],
 "call": {
  "Gauge": {
   "value": "@cpu",
   "label": "CPU %"
  }
 },
 "pitfalls": [
  "Zone colours without colour expressions: three arcs of the same sweep are drawn on top of each other, green always, amber with paint alpha step(f, warnAt), red with alpha step(f, alertAt); the topmost visible one wins. The text paint then resets alpha to 1",
  "step(x, edge) is x > edge, and clamp takes (min, max, value)",
  "The fraction and the sweep are locals: each is one float expression shared by the three arcs and both alphas (a literal value folds them to numbers, so nothing is computed at run time)",
  "A fixed `size` is the box the call asks for: a 160 dp gauge still overflows a narrower widget. Where the space varies, pass fill: true and give the call a sized or weighted parent (weights ignore spacedBy: put the gap in a padding). Either way the face is drawn at `size` and a canvas variable (min(componentWidth(), componentHeight())) with one translate + scale fits it to the box it got, centred, so a call clamped by a smaller parent shrinks instead of being cut off; every coordinate stays a folded number. The variable keeps the call out of pattern mode, where min() over componentWidth()/componentHeight() comes out wrong (C++ and TS players)",
  "An ideal band (bandLo..bandHi) replaces the zones: the track gets a wider translucent success segment with a tick at each end, and the value arc is amber with a success copy on top at paint alpha inBand = (1 - step(bandLo, value)) * (1 - step(value, bandHi)), ends inclusive. In mono the band is a thicker grey track section between two ticks, and a dot rides the end of the value arc: filled inside the band, hollow (background-filled ring) outside. The band is on when bandHi is given: pass both, and don't write a literal bandHi of 0 (it reads as absent; use a variable or a tiny offset)"
 ],
 "body": {
  "canvas": {
   "modifiers": [
    {
     "$if": "fill",
     "then": "fillMaxSize",
     "else": {
      "size": "@size"
     }
    },
    {
     "semantics": {
      "contentDescription": "@label"
     }
    }
   ],
   "commands": [
    {
     "variable": {
      "name": "s",
      "value": "min(componentWidth(), componentHeight())"
     }
    },
    {
     "translate": {
      "dx": "(componentWidth() - @s) / 2",
      "dy": "(componentHeight() - @s) / 2"
     }
    },
    {
     "scale": {
      "sx": "@s / @size",
      "sy": "@s / @size"
     }
    },
    {
     "paint": {
      "ops": [
       {
        "color": "@colors.track"
       },
       {
        "style": "stroke"
       },
       {
        "strokeWidth": {
         "$if": "theme.mono",
         "then": 1.5,
         "else": "@thickness"
        }
       },
       {
        "strokeCap": "round"
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "drawArc": {
      "left": "@thickness",
      "top": "@thickness",
      "right": "@size - @thickness",
      "bottom": "@size - @thickness",
      "startAngle": 150,
      "sweepAngle": 240
     }
    },
    {
     "$if": "bandHi",
     "then": [
      {
       "$if": "theme.mono",
       "then": [
        {
         "paint": {
          "ops": [
           {
            "strokeWidth": "@thickness * 0.75"
           },
           {
            "strokeCap": "butt"
           }
          ]
         }
        },
        {
         "drawArc": {
          "left": "@thickness",
          "top": "@thickness",
          "right": "@size - @thickness",
          "bottom": "@size - @thickness",
          "startAngle": "@bandA",
          "sweepAngle": "@bandB - @bandA"
         }
        },
        {
         "paint": {
          "ops": [
           {
            "color": "@colors.onSurface"
           },
           {
            "strokeWidth": "@theme.stroke"
           }
          ]
         }
        },
        {
         "save": {
          "commands": [
           {
            "rotate": {
             "angle": "@bandA",
             "pivotX": "@size / 2",
             "pivotY": "@size / 2"
            }
           },
           {
            "drawLine": {
             "x1": "@size - @thickness * 1.5 - 3",
             "y1": "@size / 2",
             "x2": "@size - @thickness / 2 + 3",
             "y2": "@size / 2"
            }
           }
          ]
         }
        },
        {
         "save": {
          "commands": [
           {
            "rotate": {
             "angle": "@bandB",
             "pivotX": "@size / 2",
             "pivotY": "@size / 2"
            }
           },
           {
            "drawLine": {
             "x1": "@size - @thickness * 1.5 - 3",
             "y1": "@size / 2",
             "x2": "@size - @thickness / 2 + 3",
             "y2": "@size / 2"
            }
           }
          ]
         }
        },
        {
         "paint": {
          "ops": [
           {
            "color": "@colors.success"
           },
           {
            "strokeWidth": "@thickness / 2"
           },
           {
            "strokeCap": "round"
           }
          ]
         }
        },
        {
         "drawArc": {
          "left": "@thickness",
          "top": "@thickness",
          "right": "@size - @thickness",
          "bottom": "@size - @thickness",
          "startAngle": 150,
          "sweepAngle": "@sweep"
         }
        },
        {
         "save": {
          "commands": [
           {
            "rotate": {
             "angle": "150 + @sweep",
             "pivotX": "@size / 2",
             "pivotY": "@size / 2"
            }
           },
           {
            "paint": {
             "ops": [
              {
               "color": "@colors.background"
              },
              {
               "style": "fill"
              }
             ]
            }
           },
           {
            "drawCircle": {
             "cx": "@size - @thickness",
             "cy": "@size / 2",
             "radius": "@thickness * 0.6"
            }
           },
           {
            "paint": {
             "ops": [
              {
               "color": "@colors.onSurface"
              },
              {
               "style": "stroke"
              },
              {
               "strokeWidth": "@theme.stroke"
              }
             ]
            }
           },
           {
            "drawCircle": {
             "cx": "@size - @thickness",
             "cy": "@size / 2",
             "radius": "@thickness * 0.6"
            }
           },
           {
            "paint": {
             "ops": [
              {
               "style": "fill"
              },
              {
               "alpha": "@inBand"
              }
             ]
            }
           },
           {
            "drawCircle": {
             "cx": "@size - @thickness",
             "cy": "@size / 2",
             "radius": "@thickness * 0.6"
            }
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       ],
       "else": [
        {
         "paint": {
          "ops": [
           {
            "color": "@colors.success"
           },
           {
            "alpha": 0.3
           },
           {
            "strokeWidth": "@thickness + 6"
           },
           {
            "strokeCap": "butt"
           }
          ]
         }
        },
        {
         "drawArc": {
          "left": "@thickness",
          "top": "@thickness",
          "right": "@size - @thickness",
          "bottom": "@size - @thickness",
          "startAngle": "@bandA",
          "sweepAngle": "@bandB - @bandA"
         }
        },
        {
         "paint": {
          "ops": [
           {
            "color": "@colors.warning"
           },
           {
            "alpha": 1
           },
           {
            "strokeWidth": "@thickness"
           },
           {
            "strokeCap": "round"
           }
          ]
         }
        },
        {
         "drawArc": {
          "left": "@thickness",
          "top": "@thickness",
          "right": "@size - @thickness",
          "bottom": "@size - @thickness",
          "startAngle": 150,
          "sweepAngle": "@sweep"
         }
        },
        {
         "paint": {
          "ops": [
           {
            "color": "@colors.success"
           },
           {
            "alpha": "@inBand"
           }
          ]
         }
        },
        {
         "drawArc": {
          "left": "@thickness",
          "top": "@thickness",
          "right": "@size - @thickness",
          "bottom": "@size - @thickness",
          "startAngle": 150,
          "sweepAngle": "@sweep"
         }
        },
        {
         "paint": {
          "ops": [
           {
            "color": "@colors.onSurface"
           },
           {
            "alpha": 1
           },
           {
            "strokeWidth": "@theme.stroke"
           },
           {
            "strokeCap": "butt"
           }
          ]
         }
        },
        {
         "save": {
          "commands": [
           {
            "rotate": {
             "angle": "@bandA",
             "pivotX": "@size / 2",
             "pivotY": "@size / 2"
            }
           },
           {
            "drawLine": {
             "x1": "@size - @thickness * 1.5 - 3",
             "y1": "@size / 2",
             "x2": "@size - @thickness / 2 + 3",
             "y2": "@size / 2"
            }
           }
          ]
         }
        },
        {
         "save": {
          "commands": [
           {
            "rotate": {
             "angle": "@bandB",
             "pivotX": "@size / 2",
             "pivotY": "@size / 2"
            }
           },
           {
            "drawLine": {
             "x1": "@size - @thickness * 1.5 - 3",
             "y1": "@size / 2",
             "x2": "@size - @thickness / 2 + 3",
             "y2": "@size / 2"
            }
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       ]
      }
     ],
     "else": [
      {
       "$if": "theme.mono",
       "then": [
        {
         "paint": {
          "ops": [
           {
            "color": "@colors.onSurface"
           },
           {
            "strokeWidth": "@theme.stroke"
           },
           {
            "strokeCap": "butt"
           }
          ]
         }
        },
        {
         "save": {
          "commands": [
           {
            "rotate": {
             "angle": "150 + @warnAt * 240",
             "pivotX": "@size / 2",
             "pivotY": "@size / 2"
            }
           },
           {
            "drawLine": {
             "x1": "@size - @thickness * 1.5 - 3",
             "y1": "@size / 2",
             "x2": "@size - @thickness / 2 + 3",
             "y2": "@size / 2"
            }
           }
          ]
         }
        },
        {
         "save": {
          "commands": [
           {
            "rotate": {
             "angle": "150 + @alertAt * 240",
             "pivotX": "@size / 2",
             "pivotY": "@size / 2"
            }
           },
           {
            "drawLine": {
             "x1": "@size - @thickness * 1.5 - 3",
             "y1": "@size / 2",
             "x2": "@size - @thickness / 2 + 3",
             "y2": "@size / 2"
            }
           }
          ]
         }
        },
        {
         "paint": {
          "ops": [
           {
            "color": "@colors.success"
           },
           {
            "strokeWidth": "@thickness / 2"
           },
           {
            "strokeCap": "round"
           }
          ]
         }
        },
        {
         "drawArc": {
          "left": "@thickness",
          "top": "@thickness",
          "right": "@size - @thickness",
          "bottom": "@size - @thickness",
          "startAngle": 150,
          "sweepAngle": "@sweep"
         }
        }
       ],
       "else": [
        {
         "paint": {
          "ops": [
           {
            "color": "@colors.success"
           }
          ]
         }
        },
        {
         "drawArc": {
          "left": "@thickness",
          "top": "@thickness",
          "right": "@size - @thickness",
          "bottom": "@size - @thickness",
          "startAngle": 150,
          "sweepAngle": "@sweep"
         }
        },
        {
         "paint": {
          "ops": [
           {
            "color": "@colors.warning"
           },
           {
            "alpha": "step(@frac, @warnAt)"
           }
          ]
         }
        },
        {
         "drawArc": {
          "left": "@thickness",
          "top": "@thickness",
          "right": "@size - @thickness",
          "bottom": "@size - @thickness",
          "startAngle": 150,
          "sweepAngle": "@sweep"
         }
        },
        {
         "paint": {
          "ops": [
           {
            "color": "@colors.error"
           },
           {
            "alpha": "step(@frac, @alertAt)"
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "drawArc": {
        "left": "@thickness",
        "top": "@thickness",
        "right": "@size - @thickness",
        "bottom": "@size - @thickness",
        "startAngle": 150,
        "sweepAngle": "@sweep"
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "paint": {
      "ops": [
       {
        "color": "@colors.onSurface"
       },
       {
        "style": "fill"
       },
       {
        "alpha": 1
       },
       {
        "textSize": "@size * 0.22"
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "drawTextAnchored": {
      "text": {
       "type": "textFromFloat",
       "value": "@value",
       "whole": 4,
       "decimal": "@decimals",
       "flags": 5
      },
      "x": "@size / 2",
      "y": "@size / 2",
      "panX": 0,
      "panY": 0
     }
    },
    {
     "$if": "label",
     "then": {
      "paint": {
       "ops": [
        {
         "color": "@colors.muted"
        },
        {
         "textSize": "@size * 0.1"
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "$if": "label",
     "then": {
      "drawTextAnchored": {
       "text": "@label",
       "x": "@size / 2",
       "y": "@size * 0.72",
       "panX": 0,
       "panY": 0
      }
     }
    }
   ]
  }
 }
}
